# Test build configuration (npm run build:test → vite build --mode testdeploy).
#
# The mode itself drives the isolation: the shell gets a CSP that restricts every
# connection to its own origin, the manifest and the service-worker cache prefix
# identify the test stand, and CI verifies all of it in the built artifact (see
# vite.config.ts and scripts/ci/check-artifacts.mjs). This flag is the
# consistency check for that mode: the build fails without it.
VITE_BUILD_KIND=test
